                                                "sense_id": "285ab53e-2067-3edf-bd89-f953b6f7dea4",
                                                "text": "He took off his thick black coat and threw it to Harry.\n\"You can kip under that,\" he said. \"Don' mind it if wriggles a bit, I think I still got a couple o' dormice in one o' the pockets.\""
