                                                "sense_id": "53fb651e-e427-3a63-a42f-b9b7bd169ee2",
                                                "text": "Again Turk placed the pennies on the kip. He took his time, deliberate over the small action, held the kip for a long breathless moment, then jerked his wrist and the pennies were in the air."
                                            },
                                            {
